| DB column/table | `skill-db-schema-json.prompt.md` |
| UI page/feature | `skill-frontend-feature.prompt.md` |
| Permission-gated UI | `skill-permission-gated-ui.prompt.md` |
| Zod on routes | `skill-validated-route.prompt.md` |
| KPI drill-down | `skill-dashboard-kpi-drilldown.prompt.md` |
| Jira | `skill-jira-integration.prompt.md` |
| Bug fix | `skill-bugfix-debug.prompt.md` |

## Quality bar

- TypeScript strict; avoid `any` — use interfaces in `server/types/` or colocated types.
- Minimal diff: do not refactor unrelated code.
- No new features unless asked; bug fixes and requested scope only.
- Do not edit plan files (`.cursor/plans/`) unless user asks.
- Git: commit only when user explicitly requests.

